  - What belongs where:
      - cli/: argument parsing and I/O adaptation only
      - runtime/: orchestration and turn lifecycle
      - model/: provider streaming + retry/fallback policy
      - tools/: tool contracts and built-in tool implementations
      - policy/: permission/rule/risk-label logic
      - storage/: append-only transcripts + resume reconstruction
      - sandbox/: policy checks independent of tool logic
      - mcp/: extension seam, disabled in v1 runtime path
      - contracts/: machine-validated schemas
      - tests/: behavior and conformance
  - Must not be placed:
      - no business logic in cli/
      - no filesystem mutation logic in runtime/ (tool-only)
      - no provider API code in policy/
      - no test fixtures under src/

