  ## SECTION 3 — CORE MODULES AND CLASS RESPONSIBILITIES

  | Module path | Class/function | Responsibility | Inputs / Outputs | Invariants | Must never do |
  |---|---|---|---|---|---|
  | ccr/cli/main.py | run_cli() | process entrypoint | argv -> exit code | single top-level exception boundary | execute
  tools directly |
  | ccr/cli/parser.py | build_parser() | CLI contract parsing | argv tokens -> typed options | flags validated before
  runtime start | mutate session/transcript |
  | ccr/runtime/orchestrator.py | SessionOrchestrator | full session lifecycle | SessionConfig, input stream -> event
  stream + terminal state | all side effects evented + persisted (when required) | parse CLI args |
  | ccr/runtime/turn_fsm.py | TurnStateMachine | deterministic turn progression | user input + model/tool callbacks ->
  state transitions | legal transition graph enforced | call filesystem/shell directly |
  | ccr/model/stream_adapter.py | ModelStreamAdapter | normalize provider stream to internal deltas/blocks | prompt/
  context/tools -> typed stream events | stream output strictly ordered | decide permissions |
  | ccr/model/retry_fallback.py | RetryFallbackManager | retry timing + model fallback decisions | error + retry context
  -> retry/fallback action | bounded retries, deterministic policy | execute provider requests directly |
  | ccr/tools/base.py | BaseTool | base tool contract | validated input + context -> ToolResultEnvelope | schema-
  validated input, structured output | bypass permission engine |
  | ccr/tools/registry.py | ToolRegistry | active tool set resolution | builtin + policy filters -> callable tool map |
  name uniqueness | execute tools |
  | ccr/tools/executor.py | ToolExecutor | tool call lifecycle | tool requests -> execution events + result | exactly
  one terminal result per call | choose permission mode |
  | ccr/policy/engine.py | PermissionEngine | strict deterministic allow/deny/ask decision | PermissionRequest ->
  PermissionDecision | precedence table is strict | execute tool |
  | ccr/policy/rules.py | RuleStore | load/persist/merge rules | config files + session updates -> normalized ruleset |
  deterministic merge order | classify runtime behavior probabilistically |
  | ccr/storage/transcript_store.py | TranscriptStore | append-only JSONL persistence | event records -> durable lines |
  monotonic sequence, no rewrite, fsync discipline | infer permissions |
  | ccr/storage/resume_loader.py | ResumeLoader | reconstruct resumable runtime state | session id/path -> ResumeState |
  graph consistency checks | mutate past transcript records |
  | ccr/tools/subprocess_runner.py | SubprocessRunner | controlled subprocess execution | command + timeout + cancel
  token -> stdout/stderr/status | timeout/kill semantics fixed | decide policy |
  | ccr/tools/file_edit_engine.py | FileEditEngine | deterministic replace/patch/write workflow | file path + edit
  request -> patch + updated content | staleness and match-count checks | auto-fix ambiguous edits |
  | ccr/sandbox/lite_policy.py | SandboxPolicyAdapter | v1-lite sandbox decisions | tool request -> allow/deny
  constraints | path normalization always | execute subprocess |
  | ccr/mcp/provider_interface.py | MCPAdapterPlaceholder | stable extension seam for v1.5 | provider config -> external
  tool descriptors | no v1 runtime side effects | connect to MCP in v1 |

